# No long dashes

Never write an em dash (`—`, U+2014). Use a hyphen (`-`) instead, in prose, titles, UI copy, translations, and comments.

```
Bad:  From idea to finished material — we lead the process.
Good: From idea to finished material - we lead the process.
```
